	(text "Each Keystone 5110 0603 jumper sits in series with one load supply: remove it to power that part off. The LED shows the switched rail is present. A part left unpowered can still be fed through its signal pins, so disconnect the cable too when you need it fully dead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
